type":"fixture/sacred/gravestone","place":{"on":"tile","map":"ossuary","x":20,"y":16},"name":{"en":"A niche of the Order","zh":"骑士团的墓龛"},"props":{"text":"Carved, and left empty: FENNICK, SQUIRE TO THE COMMANDER. The stone is clean. Someone keeps it swept.","text_zh":"刻好了字，却空着：芬尼克，骑士长的侍从。石头很干净。有人一直在打扫。"}},{"id":"ossuary.roll","type":"fixture/sacred/altar","place":{"on":"tile","map":"ossuary","x":15,"y":12},"name":{"en":"The roll of the Order","zh":"骑士团名册"},"tags":["readable"],"props":{"text":"THE ORDER OF THE THORN. Forty-one names, the oldest worn smooth. The last, cut deeper than the rest: ALBERIC, KNIGHT-COMMANDER, WHO KNELT TO CHILDREN. TAKEN UP BY THE HOLY CITY TO BEAR THE CROWN. HE HOLDS.","text_zh":"荆棘骑士团。四十一个名字，最老的已经磨平了。最后一个比别的刻得都深：阿尔贝里克，骑士长，曾向孩子们下跪。蒙圣城擢选，承戴荆棘冠。他坚守着。"}},{"type":"item/armor/pauldrons","name":{"en":"Brother Odo's Pauldrons","zh":"奥多修士的护肩"},"tags":["material:steel","metal","conductive","quality:vowed"],"props":{"def":5,"level":3,"vow":"holdfast","sub:critDamage":0.1,"sub:lifesteal":1,"sub:cdr":0.06,"sub:dodge":0.02,"sub:atk":2},"id":"ossuary~ia","place":{"on":"tile","map":"ossuary","x":9,"y":8}},{"type":"item/valuable/ring","name":{"en":"Sister Maren's Ring","zh":"玛伦修女的戒指"},"tags":["material:silver","metal","conductive","holy","quality:vowed"],"props":{"atk":3,"level":3,"vow":"mercy","sub:lifesteal":1,"sub:dodge":0.02,"sub:cdr":0.03,"sub:attackHaste":0.02,"sub:def":4,"def":1,"lifesteal":1},"id":"ossuary~ib","place":{"on":"tile","map":"ossuary","x":21,"y":8}},{"id":"ossuary~cc","type":"actor/creature/undead/skeleton","place":{"on":"tile","map":"ossuary","x":3,"y":7},"facing":"down","ai":{"behaviour":"melee","temper":"aggressive","sight":4,"home":{"map":"ossuary","x":3,"y":7},"leash":7}},{"id":"ossuary~cd","type":"actor/creature/undead/skeleton","place":{"on":"tile","map":"ossuary","x":12,"y":10},"facing":"down","ai":{"behaviour":"melee","temper":"aggressive","sight":4,"home":{"map":"ossuary","x":12,"y":10},"leash":7}},{"id":"ossuary~ce","type":"a